"text": "伏设在空地。敌军踏入时受2伤害并耗掉本回合的攻击机会。己方从牌库调入一张至多3费法术。", "tag": "陷阱 · 踏入断攻补给"
}, {
"id": "sleet_drums", "name": "鼓落霜河", "short": "鼓", "type": "environment", "cost": 6, "set_id": "pilgrim",
"effect": "weather", "weather": "snow", "duration": 4, "rally": {"target_side": "ally", "shape": "row", "radius": 2, "shield": 1}, "draw": 1, "combo": {"draw": 2},
"text": "全场寒潮持续4个行动回合。己方指挥官同横列2格内友军各获1护盾。若牌库有牌，抽1张。连携 · 改为最多2张。", "tag": "天气 · 连携补手"
}, {
"id": "cracked_threshold", "name": "门槛之下", "short": "钉", "type": "trap", "cost": 7, "set_id": "pilgrim",
"effect": "trap", "trigger": "step", "amount": 4, "clear_shield": true, "root": true,
"text": "伏设在空地。敌军踏入时先失去全部护盾，再受4伤害。存活者停止余下移动，本回合定身。", "tag": "陷阱 · 破盾止步"
}, {
"id": "bellglass_cover", "name": "蓝钟留庇", "short": "印", "type": "trap", "cost": 8, "set_id": "pilgrim",
"effect": "trap", "trigger": "spell", "amount": 4, "rally": {"target_side": "ally", "shape": "column", "radius": 1, "healing": 2, "shield": 1},
"text": "伏设于友军。下一次敌方术击前，保护对象获4护盾。同纵列1格内友军各恢复2生命，再各获1护盾。", "tag": "陷阱 · 术击护阵"
}, {
"id": "dusk_serein", "name": "暮雨迎归人", "short": "雨", "type": "environment", "cost": 9, "set_id": "pilgrim",
"effect": "weather", "weather": "rain", "duration": 6, "rally": {"target_side": "ally", "shape": "cross", "radius": 2, "healing": 3, "cleanse": true}, "supply": [{"type": "trap", "max": 6}],
"text": "全场暴雨持续6个行动回合。己方指挥官十字2格内友军各恢复3生命并解缚，再从牌库调入一张至多6费陷阱。", "tag": "天气 · 救援补阵"
}, {
"id": "parcel_seal", "name": "拆绳见援", "short": "封", "type": "spell", "cost": 2, "set_id": "pilgrim",
"effect": "supply", "supply": [{"type": "environment", "max": 3}], "combo": {"supply": [{"type": "environment", "max": 3}, {"type": "unit", "max": 2}]},
"text": "调入一张至多3费的环境牌。连携 · 再调入一张至多2费的部队。至少须有一张可调入。", "tag": "法术 · 连携调兵"
}, {
