"effect": "formation", "target_side": "enemy", "shape": "row", "radius": 2, "damage": 2, "commander_damage": 1, "rally_shield": 1, "combo": {"rally_shield": 2},
"text": "目标横列2格内普通敌军各受2伤害，敌方指挥官受1伤害。友军各获1护盾。连携 · 友军改获2护盾。", "tag": "法术 · 横列攻守"
}, {
