"effect": "formation", "target_side": "ally", "shape": "row", "radius": 2, "healing": 2, "combo": {"shield": 1, "cleanse": true},
"text": "目标横列2格内友军各恢复2生命。连携 · 还各获1护盾并解除定身。", "tag": "法术 · 连携救援"
}, {
